  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/610492/description_19c704fd-83da-48c6-93bc-c39ae13831db.png\" alt=\"crispytwig x Starfish\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maQ6tE6Nsd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1378839788659933345?style=flat-square&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Discord&amp;color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-but-better\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/989479?style=flat-square&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=CurseForge&amp;color=f16436\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbuilding-but-better\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/building-but-better?style=flat-square&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Modrinth&amp;color=00af5c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-but-better/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MC-1.20.1-6b6b88?style=flat-square&amp;logo=minecraft&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Versions\"></a></p><h3>⚠️ 注意：</h3><p>本模组目前正针对1.21.1版本进行全面重制——我将从零开始重新设计所有方块、功能、代码和美术素材。在此期间，请各位耐心等待 :-)</p><hr><h3>📋 关于模组</h3><p><strong>Building But Better</strong> 是一款受《征服》《Cocricot》《迷你世界》等模组启发的建筑增强模组，旨在通过扩展Minecraft的方块形态并增加基于方块交互的自定义功能，成为原版建筑玩家的核心工具。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obfbftBwscY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube宣传片</a></p>",
